[67.116677, "o", "289:A typical profile consists of a preheat, dryout, and reflow\r\n291:the preheat section, the goal is to fully preheat the SMT\r\n293:150°C. The most critical parameter in the preheat section\r\n368:PREHEAT1\r\n372:PREHEAT2\r\n408:may crack if the rise rate in the preheat zone is excessive. Solder spatter and solder balls may occur if drying\r\n414:preheat is insufficient, solder spatter and balls may occur\r\n1342:enters a second plenum, where the gas is preheated by a\r\n1356:blower through the preheater plenum arrangement. The\r\n1409:from these zones is reheated and used in the preheat zone.\r\n"]
